{% set review_states = {"not_reviewed": "⏳ 尚未审查", "reviewing": "🔎 审查中", "preliminary": "📝 初步结果已发布 · 深度审查中", "approved": "✅ 已通过", "changes_requested": "🚧 需要修改", "comment": "💬 已完成 · 有补充意见", "incomplete": "⏸️ 部分审查未完成"} -%}
{% set stage_states = {"pending": "⏳ 待开始", "running": "🔎 进行中", "completed": "✅ 已完成", "skipped": "➖ 无需执行", "incomplete": "⏸️ 未完成"} -%}
{% set finding_states = {"unresolved": "🚧 未解决", "partial": "🛠️ 部分解决", "resolved": "✅ 已解决", "superseded": "➖ 已被后续变更取代"} -%}
{% set priorities = {"P0": ["high", "High"], "P1": ["high", "High"], "P2": ["medium", "Medium"], "P3": ["low", "Low"]} -%}
{% set decisions = {"remove": "删除", "merge": "合并", "replace": "替换", "retain": "保留"} -%}
## Nyanpasu 审查看板

**审查状态：** {{ review_states[data.status] }}

**{% if data.status == "not_reviewed" %}待审查版本{% else %}审查版本{% endif %}：** {{ data.source.head_sha }}

**目标分支：** {% if meta.repository %}<a href="{{ meta.repository.url }}/tree/{{ data.source.base_ref }}">{{ data.source.base_ref }}</a>{% else %}{{ data.source.base_ref }}{% endif %}

{{ data.summary | md_body }}

{% if data.stages is defined -%}
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>审查阶段</th><th>进度</th><th>范围与结果</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for key, label in [("general", "常规审查"), ("deep", "深度审查")] -%}
<tr>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ label }}</td>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ stage_states[data.stages[key].status] }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ data.stages[key].summary | md_body }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

{% endif -%}
{% if data.ci is defined -%}
{% set ci_states = {"analyzing": "🔎 分析中", "completed": "已分析", "incomplete": "⏸️ 分析未完成"} -%}
### CI 异常

**检查版本：** {{ data.ci.source.head_sha }} · {{ ci_states[data.ci.status] }}

<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>失败检查</th><th>原因与现状</th><th>证据</th><th>建议下一步</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for id, failure in data.ci.failures | dictsort_natural -%}
<tr>
<td valign="top">{{ failure.name | md_link(failure.url) }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ failure.summary | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{% if failure.evidence is defined %}{{ failure.evidence | md_body }}{% else %}待确认{% endif %}</td>
<td valign="top">{% if failure.next_step is defined %}{{ failure.next_step | md_body }}{% else %}待分析{% endif %}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

{% endif -%}
{% if data.findings -%}
### 审查发现

{% for label, statuses, expanded in [("待处理", ["unresolved", "partial"], true), ("已解决或已取代", ["resolved", "superseded"], false)] -%}
<details{% if expanded %} open{% endif %}>
<summary><strong>{{ label }}</strong></summary>

<table>
<thead>
{# Unbreakable heading padding keeps GitHub from shrinking the 62px badge. #}
<tr><th>编号</th><th nowrap>&emsp;严重性&emsp;</th><th>问题</th><th>状态</th><th nowrap>规则来源</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for id, finding in data.findings | dictsort_natural if finding.status in statuses -%}
<tr>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ id | md_code }}</td>
<td nowrap align="center" valign="top"><picture><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/{{ priorities[finding.priority][0] }}-v2-dark.svg"><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" srcset="https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/{{ priorities[finding.priority][0] }}-v2-light.svg"><img src="https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/{{ priorities[finding.priority][0] }}-v2-light.png" alt="{{ priorities[finding.priority][1] }} severity" width="62" height="18" align="texttop"></picture></td>
<td valign="top">{{ finding.title | md_link(finding.url) }}{% if finding.kind is defined and finding.kind == "simplification" %}<br><sub>精简建议（非阻塞）</sub>{% endif %}</td>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ finding_states[finding.status] }}</td>
<td valign="top">{% if finding.rule is defined %}{{ finding.rule.title | md_link(finding.rule.url) }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
</tr>
{% else -%}
<tr><td colspan="5">暂无{{ label }}的记录。</td></tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

</details>

{% endfor -%}
{% elif data.status == "approved" -%}
没有未解决的审查问题。
{% elif data.status in ["not_reviewed", "reviewing", "preliminary", "incomplete"] -%}
尚无已确认的问题记录；这不代表审查通过。
{% else -%}
本次没有需要列入看板的问题。
{% endif %}

{% if data.scope is defined -%}
{% set scope = data.scope[data.source.inventory_id] -%}
<details>
<summary><strong>提交范围</strong> · 接收 {{ scope.counts.accept }} · 建议移出 {{ scope.counts.relocate }} · 待确认 {{ scope.counts.clarify }}</summary>

接收 {{ scope.counts.accept }} 个文件 · 建议移出 {{ scope.counts.relocate }} 个文件 · 待确认 {{ scope.counts.clarify }} 个文件。移出与待确认部分暂停深审，不代表审查通过。

{% if scope.path_encoding is defined and scope.path_encoding == "percent" -%}
文件路径使用百分号编码，以保留非 UTF-8 文件名。

{% endif -%}
{% set scope_decisions = {"accept": "接收", "relocate": "建议移出", "clarify": "待确认"} -%}
<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>文件</th><th>结论</th><th>仓库维护必要性</th><th>依据</th><th>替代去向或方案</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for group in scope.groups -%}
<tr>
<td valign="top">{% for path in group.files %}{{ path | md_code }}<br>{% endfor %}</td>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ scope_decisions[group.decision] }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ group.reason | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ group.source | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ group.alternative | md_body }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

</details>

{% endif -%}
{% if data.simplification is defined -%}
<details>
<summary><strong>精简审查与验证依据</strong></summary>

<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>审查范围</th><th>进度</th><th>结论</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for key, label in [("production", "生产代码"), ("tests", "测试")] -%}
<tr>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ label }}</td>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ stage_states[data.simplification[key].status] }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ data.simplification[key].summary | md_body }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

{% for key, label in [("production", "生产代码"), ("tests", "测试")] -%}
{% set audit = data.simplification[key] -%}
{% if audit.entries -%}
#### {{ label }}的必要性与替代方案

<table>
<thead>
<tr><th>范围</th><th>必须保留的契约</th><th>更简单的方案</th><th>结论</th><th>依据与限制</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
{% for entry in audit.entries -%}
<tr>
<td valign="top">{{ entry.scope | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ entry.contract | md_body }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ entry.alternative | md_body }}</td>
<td nowrap valign="top">{{ decisions[entry.decision] }}</td>
<td valign="top">{{ entry.evidence | md_body }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor -%}
</tbody>
</table>

{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
</details>

{% endif %}

<div align="right">
{% set disclosure_brand = "Powered by Nyanpasu" -%}
   <sup>Powered by {{ "Nyanpasu" | md_link("https://github.com/ShigureLab/nyanpasu") }}{{ data.disclosure[(disclosure_brand | length):] }}</sup>
</div>
